 "audit": "Old /size-guide 404s and /pages/size-guide has no chart. Clothing Size Guide popup on an In The Style item, UK Single Sizes table, CM view, printed to 2 decimals; US/EU from its International Sizes table. Old 10 88/70/94 now 91/72.9/97.03; old 16 103/85/109 now 104.88/88.9/111. 18-32 added. Dual-size table (6-8 etc.) repeats the same figures.",
